the \strong{fuzzy silhouette index} (\eqn{FS}) of Campello and Hruschka (2006) is:
\deqn{
  FS = \frac{\sum_{i=1}^{n}  w_i  S(x_i) }{\sum_{i=1}^{n}  w_i},
  \qquad w_i = ( \gamma_{i(1)} - \gamma_{i(2)} )^{\alpha},
